
Hints

  A.  Hints
      - the [H]int command can be used from the Airport or Main menu.
     
      1. When you are looking for a target to complete your mission, 
         you will get 4 hints.

      2. The hints tell geographical clues on WHERE the target last 
         departed.  Follow the clues to your target!

      3. For company missions, hints are given to the exact location
         of the CEO.  Fly to the city that the hints give you, or if
         you have no idea what the hint means, you will have to fly
         to all cities and check to see if players are there!
         

  B.  Home Base and Companies
      - Home Bases and companies are mainly used for locations which
        have the weapons and armor shops, and your bank, so you can
        withdraw money.

   *  1. If you are stuck in a city without any pocket money, you will have
         to wait by hitting RETURN at the main prompt for the travelling 
         shops to get into town!

      2. If you are killed, the person killing you recieves ALL your
         pocket money, so it is good to stick it in the bank, but leave
         enough to heal and fly to other cities.

      3. Companies will give you assignments to assassinate other company
         executives.  They reward highly, with 1000 experience points for
         each mission completed!

      4. It is a good idea to make your home base away from the starting
         city of Honolulu.  If you quit the game, make sure you are far
         away from this city!  New users will try and kill you!     


  C. Fighting/Experience
     - In each battle you or your opponent recieve experience points
       to gain levels.

     1. The experience points rewarded after each successful battle 
        depend on the other users level.  If you kill someone who is
        at a lower level you will get less experience, vice versa.

     2. To gain experience levels use the command [N]ext level from Main.
        You will be given extra hit points, strength, and/or dexterity
        points.  The highest level in the game is "Mastermind Assassin"
        which can be achieved at 500000 exp.

     3. Weapons/Fighting
        a. Each weapon has different attacks and damage.  Some attack
           once each turn, some three times and so on.

        b. When the battle is ended, you recieve all your opponents
           pocket money.
     

  D. Other Hints

     o  If you try to assassinate someone and FAIL, you cannot attempt it
        again until next game you play.  All of their health points will be
        reset!
  
     o  Remember to follow your HINTS!  This is a major part of the game!
        You cannot play this game without using the [H]int function to track
        your target to his city hideout!
